## Important Notes
- Worker and API are separate processes — they share the same Redis and DB
- The worker must import from `@mog/agents` to access the agent registry
- All DB operations go through `@mog/db` Drizzle client
- Use the `@mog/lib` logger everywhere — structured JSON logging
